.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-registry-imports - Image imports (progress and history)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container registry imports  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Image imports (progress and history)

.PP
\fBactive\fR = the running import (or null) with \fBphase\fR, \fBbytes_done\fR/\fBbytes_total\fR, \fBlayers_done\fR/\fBlayers\fR; \fBjobs\fR = the last 20 imports (newest first) with \fBstate\fR and, when failed, \fBerror\fR + \fBmessage\fR; \fBlimits\fR\&.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/containers/{id}/registry/imports (operationId listContainerImageImports, scope services_read)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for imports


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro-container-registry(1)\fP
